	(text "Stack-up: L1 signal/power, L2 GND, L3 GND, L4 signal/power. Board 180 x 100 mm, 4 x M3. Bottom side: three 2x20 straight \nmale headers (J6 at x 12, J7 at x 90, J8 at x 168 mm) carry the front panel (180 x 100, 17 SMA) flat on the back of the \nboard. Rear edge: USB-C, 5 V jack, external power, H-bridge and polarizer coil terminals. Sections: A = B1 + NMR RX, B = B3 + B5 + NMR TX, \nC = the front-panel board; the power entry and the coil switches are the instructor’s (ZONE_INSTR). v0.7d: the four relays and the \ntwo isolated inputs left the main board — it offers 5 V TTL module outputs instead and switches no mains."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 17.78 43.688 0)
		(effects
